<<<Lesson>>>
title: Why reform mattered

<<<Text markdown>>>
## A movement across borders

After 1872, Filipino expatriates in Spain used newspapers and associations to
ask for representation, secularization, and freedom of speech. Read slowly and
note who writes, for whom, and at what risk.
<<<Text/>>>

<<<Quote>>>
text: The pen is mightier than the sword only when it tells the truth.
source: Marcelo H. del Pilar
citation: Diariong Tagalog, exact issue and page or stable archive URL
<<<Quote/>>>

