<<<Lesson>>>
title: Reading La Solidaridad

<<<Text markdown>>>
## How to read an editorial

Identify the claim, the evidence cited, and what is missing. A strong answer
quotes one line and explains what it proves.
<<<Text/>>>

<<<Checkpoint>>>
prompt: Which condition made overseas publication useful?
answerHint: Think about colonial censorship of presses in Manila.
